[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3]

; Decoration-only arena layer. Instanced into main.tscn as a top-level child
; sitting between Background and Landmarks, so tree order alone puts every
; prop behind the mobs without a single z_index on a node the tests read.
; Nothing in here collides: arena.gd builds Sprite2D props only, and the leaf
; emitter is the one CPUParticles2D. The walls, the Obstacles container and
; the spawn points are untouched and still live in main.tscn.

